                I'm a Technology Lead with over 10 years of experience architecting and delivering large-scale, high-impact web applications. Most recently, I led the technical design and execution of a monolith-to-micro-frontend re-architecture for a major telecom platform, driving the High-Level Design and leading a team of 8 engineers across 5+ cross-functional teams through the migration using Webpack 5 Module Federation, Angular 17+ with Signals, and React/Redux. I enjoy owning problems end-to-end -- from system design and stakeholder alignment down to hands-on implementation and mentoring -- and have a strong track record of scaling architectures to support rapid growth in data and traffic. I'm self-driven, detail-oriented, and thrive in fast-paced, agile environments where I can combine deep technical expertise with leadership to deliver solutions of the highest quality.
              </p>
